  "implementation": [
    "Independent native_profile::JobLogic HOST interface, implemented by private Graph Logic. Existing Logic/SessionLogic virtual slots unchanged. Private Logic layout and ProfileSettings/Options layout changed; consumers await authorized rebuild.",
    "Graph JobCall pins Impl and copied Parent lease/permit, exact Logic/session generation/owner/control. Parent/actor/expiry verified before Graph source reads and around caller admission. Caller retains strong session/Logic/prefix/code and supplies authoritative exact-job checkpoint; Graph itself does not mint a JobToken/closure claim.",
    "Reserve job_binding before opaque callable transfer; use weak Graph backreference. Internal providers choose only live selected actor, checking seal rejects admission recursion, and per-session Effects reject sibling Effects.",
    "Public update/enqueue remain original-affine. Getter/snapshot/retained/lifecycle access rejects published job scope before mutable fields. No metadata lock spans Parent/proof/checkpoint or opaque provider.",
    "Existing Logic::process_native033d70 invoked without alternate message algorithm. Normal scope requires no retained invocation/active/router/opaque/locks/writers; invalidate before target retirement and postcheck before unpublish. Unknown prefixes poison and retain, no guessed unlock/replay.",
    "Optional ProfileSettings.jobs forwarded to Profile Dependencies, preserving empty->owned InlineJobs. Explicit backend selection retains ownership but does not grant native child message/scheduler authority."
  ],
